      "widgets_values": [
        "A photorealistic character and wardrobe reference board containing exactly FOUR separate pictures in one horizontal row on a light-gray background. From LEFT to RIGHT: (1) one close frontal portrait showing the complete head, hair and shoulders; (2) one neckless FRONT body-proportion reference with visible unclothed anatomical outline, bare feet; (3) one neckless FRONT view of the selected outfit; (4) one neckless BACK view of the same selected outfit. All four pictures depict the same young adult woman, age 25, with the same slim adult female body proportions and matching skin tone. The three body displays have the same shoulder width, waist width, hip width and limb lengths, at the same shoulder-to-ankle scale. Each picture is fully contained in its own bounding box, with empty background above its highest point and below the feet. The two clothed outfit views retain their stockings and high heels; only the second panel is the neutral anatomical proportion study. Soft even studio light, natural fabric and skin texture."
      ],
