      "widgets_values": [
        "A neutral, nonsexual anatomical proportion study: a neckless straight-on FRONT view of the same 25-year-old adult woman shown in the portrait and the two clothed outfit panels. Her head and entire neck are invisible, with clear gray background above the complete shoulder silhouette. She has the same slim adult female proportions, shoulder width, waist width, hip width and limb lengths as both clothing views, with matching skin tone. She stands upright and square to the camera in a symmetrical relaxed measurement stance, arms slightly separated from the torso, open relaxed hands, straight legs and feet slightly apart. The figure has an unclothed body outline. The shoulders, torso, abdomen, waist, hips, arms, hands, thighs, knees, lower legs and bare feet remain visible for body proportion reference. No clothing, stockings, footwear or accessories on this anatomical study. The complete figure, both hands and all toes fit within this panel with clear empty space above and below. Neutral reference photography with soft even studio light."
